  "description": "The META SX V4 ÖHLINS EDITION delivers the confidence and feel of one of the most prestigious suspension brands on the market.\n• The RXF38 m.2 Air fork offers precision and great stability on descents thanks to its Ramp Up chamber for end-stroke progressivity, plus the TTX hydraulic cartridge with three-way adjustment. The TTX22 m shock is one of the very best for enduro racing. Used by many pros, it stands out with sensitivity, support, and reliability.\n• SHIMANO XT 4-piston brakes with 203mm rotors are reliable with a sharp feel.\n• The wheels are DT SWISS EX 511 rims with DT 350 hubs. One of the best combos available.\n• The SHIMANO Deore XT 12-speed drivetrain is an excellent choice for climbing and precise gear selection on steep slopes.",
